// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Arrays, maps and sets
// Demonstrates: building and combining arrays, the persistent
// ordered Map and Set, and the generated ordering (⍋, <) that
// keys and sorting rely on.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

squares ≔ ⊡(λ(n: ⟁) → n ✱ n)(⍳(10))
tail ≔ ⌷(5)(5)(squares)
joined ≔ ⍪(tail)(⊠(2)(0))
sorted ≔ ⍋(["pear", "apple", "fig"])

ages ≔ ⊎(⊎(⍬)("ada")(36))("alan")(41)
adaAge ≔ ⌕(ages)("ada")

seen ≔ ⊌(⊌(⍭)("a"))("a")

result ≔ ⊛(ages) ✚ ⊚(seen) ✚ #(joined)
❧
